      "statement": "The clap-derived `Cli`/`Command` in src/cli.rs is dispatched from src/main.rs; `render` is the default subcommand (used when the user passes none) and reads all of stdin, resolves config, injects the current epoch time, and prints `render_line` output to stdout.",
